---
layout: page
---
{% comment %}
  Event page. Renders one Event document from the _events collection from its
  structured fields: dates with per-day notes, venue, format, audience, and
  the RSVP block. Unset fields render as a visible TBA marker (never blank),
  and an empty rsvp_url renders a disabled "RSVP link coming soon" button
  that becomes a real link once the URL is set. The build harness
  (test/assert_site.js) asserts the dates, the placeholder state and the
  Events index grouping.

  P1 (issue #25): the day dates and the field labels are set in the mono
  family (.ideas-date treatment — labels and dates only, per the P1 rule),
  the details rows are rule-separated like the P1 dated streams, and the
  RSVP button reuses the P1 filled-button look (ramp amber on Ink).
{% endcomment %}

<style>
  /* P1's page head: title and lead (as on the Research page). */
  .post-header {
    padding: 56px 0 8px;
  }
  .post-title {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 1.4rem + 2vw, 2.75rem);
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    margin: 0 0 12px;
  }
  .post-description {
    color: var(--global-text-color-light);
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    margin: 0;
  }

  article p {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.75;
  }

  /* The event's days: dates in the mono .ideas-date treatment, notes in the
     muted sans beside them. */
  .event-days {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 24px 0 0;
    padding: 0;
  }
  .event-days li {
    margin-bottom: 6px;
  }
  .event-day-note {
    color: var(--global-text-color-light);
  }

  /* Structured details: rule-separated rows, labels in the mono family. */
  .event-details {
    margin: 32px 0;
  }
  .event-detail {
    display: flex;
    gap: 24px;
    padding: 14px 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--global-divider-color);
  }
  .event-detail:first-child {
    border-top: none;
    padding-top: 0;
  }
  .event-detail dt {
    flex: 0 0 9rem;
    padding-top: 3px;
    font-family: var(--ideas-font-mono);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--global-text-color-light);
  }
  .event-detail dd {
    margin: 0;
    min-width: 0;
  }
  .event-detail dd p {
    margin: 0 0 8px;
  }
  .event-detail dd p:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }
  @media (max-width: 560px) {
    .event-detail {
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 4px;
    }
    /* Stacked: the 9rem basis would become a height in column direction. */
    .event-detail dt {
      flex: none;
    }
  }

  /* Unset fields render as a visible dashed mono badge, never blank. */
  .event-tba {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 2px 8px;
    border: 1px dashed var(--global-divider-color);
    border-radius: 6px;
    font-family: var(--ideas-font-mono);
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--global-text-color-light);
  }

  /* The RSVP button: the P1 filled button (ramp amber on Ink), as the
     prototype's .button. The placeholder is its dashed ghost. */
  .event-rsvp-button {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 10px 16px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    background: #f59e0b; /* ramp-7 */
    color: #0b1f3a; /* Ink */
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  a.event-rsvp-button:hover {
    text-decoration: none;
    background: color-mix(in srgb, #f59e0b 85%, white);
    color: #0b1f3a;
  }
  span.event-rsvp-button {
    padding: 6px 12px;
    background: transparent;
    border: 1px dashed var(--global-divider-color);
    border-radius: 8px;
    color: var(--global-text-color-light);
    font-family: var(--ideas-font-mono);
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
</style>

<p class="ideas-kicker event-kicker">{{ page.event_type }}</p>

<ul class="event-days">
  {% for day in page.days %}
    <li>
      <span class="event-day ideas-date">{{ day.date | date: '%A, %B %-d, %Y' }}</span>
      {% if day.note -%}
        <span class="event-day-note">— {{ day.note }}</span>
      {%- endif %}
    </li>
  {% endfor %}
</ul>

<dl class="event-details">
  <div class="event-detail">
    <dt>Venue</dt>
    <dd>
      {% if page.venue and page.venue.name %}
        {{ page.venue.name -}}
        {%- if page.venue.room == blank -%}
          , room <span class="event-tba">TBA</span>
        {%- else -%}
          , {{ page.venue.room -}}
        {%- endif %}
      {% else %}
        <span class="event-tba">TBA</span>
      {% endif %}
    </dd>
  </div>
  <div class="event-detail">
    <dt>Format</dt>
    <dd>{{ page.format }}</dd>
  </div>
  <div class="event-detail">
    <dt>Audience</dt>
    <dd>{{ page.audience }}</dd>
  </div>
  <div class="event-detail">
    <dt>RSVP</dt>
    <dd>
      {% if page.rsvp_required %}RSVP required.{% endif %}
      {% if page.rsvp_url == blank %}
        <span class="event-rsvp-button" aria-disabled="true">RSVP link coming soon</span>
      {% else %}
        <a class="event-rsvp-button" href="{{ page.rsvp_url }}">RSVP</a>
      {% endif %}
      {% if page.rsvp_deadline == blank %}
        Deadline: <span class="event-tba">TBA</span>.
      {% else %}
        Deadline: {{ page.rsvp_deadline | date: '%B %-d, %Y' }}.
      {% endif %}
    </dd>
  </div>
  <div class="event-detail">
    <dt>Agenda</dt>
    <dd>
      {% if page.agenda == blank %}
        <span class="event-tba">TBA</span>
      {% else %}
        {{ page.agenda | markdownify }}
      {% endif %}
    </dd>
  </div>
  <div class="event-detail">
    <dt>Travel notes</dt>
    <dd>
      {% if page.travel_notes == blank %}
        <span class="event-tba">TBA</span>
      {% else %}
        {{ page.travel_notes | markdownify }}
      {% endif %}
    </dd>
  </div>
</dl>

{{ content }}
